      "title": "AA Form - Special Leave Accrual (SLA)",
      "description": "Request Special Leave Accrual under the HFP/IDP exception, the only category open after MARADMIN 341/26 suspended SLA for deployable ships, mobile units, and other duty. Approval authority is the first Marine general officer in the administrative chain of command.",
      "subject": "REQUEST FOR SPECIAL LEAVE ACCRUAL (SLA)",
      "documentType": "aa-form",
